      "content": "Those are a good start for the lifestyle stuff. To make them really actionable for the design team, I want to get more specific about the \"cultural background\" part you mentioned. When you think about the \"Conscious Connoisseur\" who has that high income and urban lifestyle, what kind of ethnic or cultural demographics do you usually see as the primary demographic for that luxury space? And for the \"Practical Parent\" segment, which specific cultural or immigrant communities should we be focusing our outreach toward for the budget cleaners? Just trying to get a sense of the typical demographics we're aiming for.",
